                "textId": "Performance_203202502_2891453868_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "探险中最难得也最宝贵的，就是耐心。\n所以，{A虎啸}哈——别着急，\n让风滚草再飞一会儿，库拉巴塔！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203202502_2891453868_content",
                "value": "探险中最难得也最宝贵的，就是耐心。\n所以，{A虎啸}哈——别着急，\n让风滚草再飞一会儿，库拉巴塔！",
